        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beaver_Creek%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town was platted in 1877, the same year the Worthington and Sioux Falls Railroad arrived.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beaver_Creek%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Charles Williams donated 80 acres of his land for the town's platting in October 1877.",
